OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested over fatal crash
OL,4,Areleased on bail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was arrested after a
OL,7,Fpedestrian died following a suspected
OL,8,Fhit-and-run crash in Hull has been
OL,9,Freleased on bail, police have said.
OL,11,FA silver car was reported exiting
OL,12,FColonial Street and turning on to Park
OL,13,FStreet before hitting a 67-year-old man
OL,14,Fat about 17:30 GMT on Saturday,
OL,15,FHumberside Police said.
OL,17,FThe pedestrian was taken to hospital
OL,18,Fbut died on Sunday morning.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
