OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested over fatal crash
OL,4,Areleased on bail
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver, a 21-year-old man, was
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of causing death
OL,8,Fby dangerous driving and failing to
OL,9,Fstop and has now been released on
OL,10,Fconditional bail, pending further
OL,11,Finquiries.
